<title>UK: TABLE-Murray Intl Trust H1 return rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Murray Intl Trust H1 return rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		50.5		   vs 22.0</p>
<p> Pretax return	    62.6		   vs 28.6</p>
<p>NOTE - For the year ending December 31, Murray said it would pay an interim dividend of 9.45p per share in three installments of 3.15p each. The company forecast its final dividend at 4.55p, making a total of 14.0p for 1997. Murray also forecast an interim dividend of 10.05p for the year ending December 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Full company name - Murray International Trust Plc --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
